test_that("perc_missing_tidy works", {

  # use the function
  tomatoes_miss &lt;- tomatoes |&gt;
    perc_missing_tidy(value)

  expect_true(tibble::is_tibble(tomatoes_miss))
})



We use perc_missing_tidy() and examine the output with an expectation.

Answer


test_that("perc_missing_tidy works", {

  # use the function
  tomatoes_miss &lt;- tomatoes |&gt;
    perc_missing_tidy(value)

  expect_true(tibble::is_tibble(tomatoes_miss))

  expect_named(
    tomatoes_miss,
    c("perc")
  )
})

